     "id": "fy3-13:aariviiva",
     "number": "Tutki: Kelpaako suora ääriviivaksi?",
     "level": 0,
     "lesson": true,
     "html": "<div class=\"interpret\"><div class=\"representation\"><p>Epävarmuutta varten etsitään jyrkin suora, joka vielä kulkee jokaisen epävarmuusjanan kautta. Kuvaan on piirretty kaksi ehdokasta, <span><math><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></semantics></math></span> ja <span class=\"math-glue\"><span><math><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></semantics></math></span>.</span> Tarkista jokainen jana: kulkeeko suora sen kautta vai sen ohi?</p> <p class=\"zoom-host\"><svg class=\"zoomable\"> <line></line> <line></line> <line></line> <line></line> <line></line> <line></line> <line></line> <line></line> <line></line> <line></line> <line></line> <line></line> <line></line> <foreignObject width=\"70\"><div class=\"fig-tex\"><span><math><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math></span></div></foreignObject> <foreignObject width=\"70\"><div class=\"fig-tex\"><span><math><semantics><mrow><mn>20</mn></mrow></semantics></math></span></div></foreignObject> <foreignObject width=\"70\"><div class=\"fig-tex\"><span><math><semantics><mrow><mn>40</mn></mrow></semantics></math></span></div></foreignObject> <foreignObject width=\"70\"><div class=\"fig-tex\"><span><math><semantics><mrow><mn>60</mn></mrow></semantics></math></span></div></foreignObject> <foreignObject width=\"70\"><div class=\"fig-tex\"><span><math><semantics><mrow><mn>80</mn></mrow></semantics></math></span></div></foreignObject> <foreignObject width=\"70\"><div class=\"fig-tex\"><span><math><semantics><mrow><mn>100</mn></mrow></semantics></math></span></div></foreignObject> <foreignObject width=\"64\"><div class=\"fig-tex\"><span><math><semantics><mrow><mn>100</mn></mrow></semantics></math></span></div></foreignObject> <foreignObject width=\"64\"><div class=\"fig-tex\"><span><math><semantics><mrow><mn>110</mn></mrow></semantics></math></span></div></foreignObject> <foreignObject width=\"64\"><div class=\"fig-tex\"><span><math><semantics><mrow><mn>120</mn><