     "html": "<p class=\"ex-done-msg\"></p><p class=\"task\">Ensihoitoauton happipullon painemittari on rikki. Pullon tilavuus on <span class=\"math-glue\"><span><math><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo separator=\"true\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">,</mo><mn>0</mn> <mtext mathvariant=\"sans-serif\">l</mtext></mrow></semantics></math></span>,</span> ja punnitsemalla selviää, että pullossa on <span><math><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">,</mo><mn>40</mn> <mtext>kg</mtext></mrow></semantics></math></span> happea. Autotallissa lämpötila on <span class=\"math-glue\"><span><math><semantics><mrow><mn>15</mn> <msup><mrow></mrow><mo>∘</mo></msup><mtext>C</mtext></mrow></semantics></math></span>.</span></p><p class=\"task more\">Mikä on hapen paine pullossa baareina <span class=\"math-glue\">(<span><math><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn> <mtext>bar</mtext></mrow></semantics></math></span></span> = <span class=\"math-glue\"><span><math><semantics><mrow><mn>100</mn> <mtext>kPa</mtext></mrow></semantics></math></span>)?</span></p><p class=\"task more\">Hapen moolimassa on <span class=\"math-glue\"><span><math><semantics><mrow><mn>32</mn><mo separator=\"true\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">,</mo><mn>0</mn> <mtext>g/mol</mtext></mrow></semantics></math></span>.</span> Käytä arvoa <span><math><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo separator=\"true\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">,</mo><mn>31</mn> <mfrac><mtext>J</mtext><mrow><mtext>mol</mtext><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>K</mtext></mrow></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math></span> ja oleta, että happi noudattaa ideaalikaasun tilanyhtälöä.</p><div class=\"ex-row\"></div>",
