     "html": "<p class=\"task\">Kemian varastosta löytyy kaasupullo, jonka etiketti on kulunut lukukelvottomaksi.</p><p class=\"task more\">Tyhjiöpumpulla tyhjennetty <span class=\"math-glue\"><span><math><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">,</mo><mn>00</mn> <mtext mathvariant=\"sans-serif\">l</mtext></mrow></semantics></math></span>:</span>n lasipallo täytetään pullon kaasulla, jolloin pallon massa kasvaa <span class=\"math-glue\"><span><math><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">,</mo><mn>15</mn> <mtext>g</mtext></mrow></semantics></math></span>.</span> Kaasun paine pallossa on <span><math><semantics><mrow><mn>101</mn> <mtext>kPa</mtext></mrow></semantics></math></span> ja lämpötila <span class=\"math-glue\"><span><math><semantics><mrow><mn>22</mn> <msup><mrow></mrow><mo>∘</mo></msup><mtext>C</mtext></mrow></semantics></math></span>.</span></p><p class=\"task more\">Laske kaasun moolimassa grammoina moolia kohti. Mikä kaasu on kyseessä, kun vaihtoehdot ovat helium <span class=\"math-glue\">(<span><math><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo separator=\"true\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">,</mo><mn>0</mn> <mtext>g/mol</mtext></mrow></semantics></math></span>),</span> typpi <span class=\"math-glue\">(<span><math><semantics><mrow><mn>28</mn> <mtext>g/mol</mtext></mrow></semantics></math></span>),</span> happi <span class=\"math-glue\">(<span><math><semantics><mrow><mn>32</mn> <mtext>g/mol</mtext></mrow></semantics></math></span>),</span> argon <span class=\"math-glue\">(<span><math><semantics><mrow><mn>40</mn> <mtext>g/mol</mtext></mrow></semantics></math></span>)</span> ja hiilidioksidi <span class=\"math-glue\">(<span><math><semantics><mrow><mn>44</mn> <mtext>g/mol</mtext></mrow></semantics></math></span>)?</span> Käytä arvoa <span class=\"math-glue\"><span><math><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo separator=\"true\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">,</mo><mn>31</mn> <mfrac><