 <td>100</td> <td>1,05</td> <td>1,05</td> </tr> <tr> <td>200</td> <td>300</td> <td>100</td> <td>2,00</td> <td>1,00</td> </tr> <tr> <td>100</td> <td>600</td> <td>50</td> <td>3,91</td> <td>0,98</td> </tr> <tr> <td>50</td> <td>150</td> <td>25</td> <td>0,98</td> <td>0,98</td> </tr> <tr> <td>180</td> <td>300</td> <td>35</td> <td>5,11</td> <td>0,99</td> </tr> </tbody> </table></div><fieldset class=\"choice list\"><p>Mitä viimeinen sarake kertoo?</p><ul class=\"choices\"><li><label><span>Paine on sama kaikissa tiloissa.</span></label></li><li><label><span>Suure <span><math><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>V</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math></span> riippuu siitä, mitä suuretta muutettiin.</span></label></li><li><label><span>Suure <span><math><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>V</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math></span> on kaikissa tiloissa lähes sama, noin 1. Erot ovat simulaation paineen satunnaista vaihtelua.</span></label></li></ul><div class=\"choice-actions\"></div><output></output></fieldset></div>",
