class=\"math-glue\"><span><math><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo separator=\"true\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">,</mo><mn>0</mn> <msup><mtext>m</mtext><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></semantics></math></span>.</span></p><p class=\"task more\">Yläpohja: <span><math><semantics><mrow><mi>U</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">,</mo><mn>090</mn> <msup><mtext>W/(m</mtext><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow></mrow><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>K)</mtext></mrow></semantics></math></span>⁠, <span class=\"math-glue\"><span><math><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>80</mn> <msup><mtext>m</mtext><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></semantics></math></span>.</span></p><p class=\"task more\">Laske kunkin rakennusosan läpi johtuva lämpöteho <span><math><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow></semantics></math></span> ja vertaa niitä.</p><fieldset class=\"order\"><ul class=\"order-list\"><li><label class=\"ord-text\">Ovi</label><select><option>Sija</option><option>1</option><option>2</option><option>3</option><option>4</option></select><span class=\"ord-right\"></span></li><li><label class=\"ord-text\">Ikkunat</label><select><option>Sija</option><option>1</option><option>2</option><option>3</option><option>4</option></select><span class=\"ord-right\"></span></li><li><label class=\"ord-text\">Seinä</label><select><option>Sija</option><option>1</option><option>2</option><option>3</option><option>4</option></select><span class=\"ord-right\"></span></li><li><label class=\"ord-text\">Yläpohja</label><select><option>Sija</option><option>1</option><option>2</option><option>3</option><option>4</option></select><span class=\"ord-right\"></span></li></ul><div class=\"choice-actions\"></div><output></output></fieldset><div class=\"ex-row\"></div>",
     "answer": "Ovi (noin <span class=\"math-glue\"><span><math><semantics><mrow><mn>60</mn> <mtext>W</mtext></mrow></semantics></math></span>),</span> yläpohja (noin <span class=\"math-glue\"><span><math><semantics><mrow><mn>220</mn> <mtext>W</mtext></mrow></semantics></math></span>),</span> ikkunat (noin <span class=\"math-glue\"><span><math><semantics><mrow><mn>290</mn> <mtext>W</mtext></mrow></semantics></math></span>),</span> seinä (noin <span class=\"math-glue\"><span><math><semantics><mrow><mn>460</mn> <mtext>W</mtext></mrow></semantics></math></span>).</span>"
